# Dual remote push

When the user asks to upload, publish, push, or "качи" the site/repo:

1. Push `main` to **both** remotes (same commit):
   - `origin` → `https://github.com/vuichovanio1/moniterm.git`
   - `moniterm` → `https://github.com/moniterm/moniterm.git`
2. Do not push only one remote unless the user explicitly names a single target.
3. After push, confirm both remotes succeeded (or report which failed).
